],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\vec X\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\vec X\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb3IdenticallyDistributedSequence}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb3IdenticallyDistributedSequence}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对函数图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 与集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{-1}[B]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\in B\\}\">\\(f^{-1}[B]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\in B\\}\\)</span>；函数图及定义域使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob3\\text{-}identically\\text{-}distributed\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcProb3IdenticallyDistributedSequence}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\vec X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathbb P(\\Omega)=1\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\omega,E^\\Omega)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S(\\vec X(n),\\Omega,\\mathcal F,E,\\mathcal E)\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall B\\in\\mathcal E\\;(\\mathbb P(\\vec X(m)^{-1}[B])=\\mathbb P(\\vec X(n)^{-1}[B]))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob3\\text{-}identically\\text{-}distributed\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcProb3IdenticallyDistributedSequence}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\vec X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathbb P(\\Omega)=1\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\omega,E^\\Omega)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S(\\vec X(n),\\Omega,\\mathcal F,E,\\mathcal E)\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall B\\in\\mathcal E\\;(\\mathbb P(\\vec X(m)^{-1}[B])=\\mathbb P(\\vec X(n)^{-1}[B]))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The probability space and measurability of every coordinate are included, not merely equality of selected preimage values.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"8902399f82dbe8a2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"对函数图 $f$ 与集合 $B$，$f^{-1}[B]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\in B\\}$；函数图及定义域使用 [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\vec X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb3IdenticallyDistributedSequence}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"f^{-1}[B]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\in B\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob3\\text{-}identically\\text{-}distributed\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcProb3IdenticallyDistributedSequence}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\vec X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathbb P(\\Omega)=1\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\omega,E^\\Omega)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S(\\vec X(n),\\Omega,\\mathcal F,E,\\mathcal E)\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall B\\in\\mathcal E\\;(\\mathbb P(\\vec X(m)^{-1}[B])=\\mathbb P(\\vec X(n)^{-1}[B]))","display":true}],"bytes":1688,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3177","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-prob3-identically-distributed-sequence.md|58-df-zfc-prob3-identically-distributed-sequence]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","ca832ed6bc22f728","8902399f82dbe8a2","36d7463d215be